{
  "action": "EXPAND_FEATURES",
  "params": {
    "code": "def compute(df):\n    import pandas as pd\n\n    income = pd.to_numeric(df[\"annual_inc\"], errors=\"coerce\")\n    loan = pd.to_numeric(df[\"loan_amnt\"], errors=\"coerce\")\n    dti = pd.to_numeric(df[\"dti\"], errors=\"coerce\")\n    months = df[\"term\"].astype(str).str.extract(r\"(\\d+)\")[0].astype(float)\n\n    out = pd.DataFrame(index=df.index)\n    out[\"term_months\"] = months\n    out[\"loan_amnt_to_income\"] = (loan / (income + 1.0)).clip(0, 10)\n    out[\"payment_to_income\"] = ((loan / months) / (income / 12.0 + 1.0)).clip(0, 10)\n    implied_existing_debt = income * dti / 100.0\n    out[\"implied_existing_debt\"] = implied_existing_debt.clip(0, 5e6)\n    out[\"loan_to_existing_debt\"] = (loan / (implied_existing_debt + 1.0)).clip(0, 50)\n    return out"
  },
  "hypothesis": "当前全量模型只用了原始额度/收入/dti 字段，树模型对除法和比值这类组合信号需要很多次分裂才能逼近。显式构造放款时点已知的偿债能力比值（借款额/年收入、月供/月收入、隐含既有负债、借款额/既有负债、期数），能直接给模型一个高信噪比的负债画像维度，尤其提升低收入高负债人群的排序能力，从而提高 OOT 上的 AUC。",
